tnjPdVmmuLQQ7kNvwFEmcmN&_nc_oc=AdoXI7ubdJy7JMFbn1Sh_ewx9MSnS06EsPUll6di6LntmKDzHnr9-HMMqdCCHC2gB38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTXeYtaG0CRykX_WIFNDbzmxliEUL9BOJGQBEKQ1SYJw&oe=6AF326B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ivYyTYbD_0EQ7kNvwFsE0LH&_nc_oc=Adr5rt0aECfjFE8HgU9a8iOKXwsD_nobi7QKr1qWLVGta7WJm0c0PsJMnLsrcqPqWkI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQOqHHdDjRUtbTqEwIy4jFPekQwxDr2OS7Kuw6gzZ0rsw&oe=6AF3284A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2T2dfW18mrgQ7kNvwETFMig&_nc_oc=Adqzz7lIjltAU_XI8Cx8m4xrVRLR3mpg_kmCu14Tn-x1WY4nwUtR9M82hL5YgIgBCao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQzTH_yRciG5CzN5M7BJ5lVT5iaAzt4yeaxtULJzhHJ8g&oe=6AF34DAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h7S6MA_eY2oQ7kNvwGlGXPR&_nc_oc=Adq1QhPUcZt4LAdLyowVMg60aEv_NkhGd96bk5bkfa3lkZBlP-3mN4P68N9_Hzi1Huc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSh4V_0EMrJJwx7C73xLNLjQrN8R0D4CirX7ddlpuBAIg&oe=6AF33703"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hffDz9OipEQQ7kNvwGJ22sb&_nc_oc=AdqtWZ1GCccLEh6H7Ju4QwId38mftHhO4ESAiHfUqGM99TwXr6W8fl-WQOa4yL-jg9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQACELi_gEXebWf6a1bAB8OD1bTQriZo2kgEGqM4oa3qQ&oe=6AF32F58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EHCIizgM7ygQ7kNvwGQwlnO&_nc_oc=Adq8iZczDVbNIgkikv5ZAGSyabFLNWI_EY5GNrsICFNDKU0y0i0VpcUmX84r4TrsBQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0XPtg7RrDjgMxzz-U-0Ynpd-oH1fDzLpe9uv_MBMnJA&oe=6AF3427C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080